WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.069 --> 00:00:04.241
(classical music)

00:00:04.241 --> 00:00:06.395
- I don't think I've
ever written a letter.

00:00:06.395 --> 00:00:08.918
- The last time I wrote a letter was

00:00:08.918 --> 00:00:11.589
in second grade when we had pen pals.

00:00:11.589 --> 00:00:14.864
- The last letter I
wrote was to Santa Claus.

00:00:14.864 --> 00:00:19.357
- I'm writing a letter
to my dad's boyfriend.

00:00:19.357 --> 00:00:20.479
- To my sister.

00:00:20.479 --> 00:00:21.413
- To my grandma.

00:00:21.413 --> 00:00:23.101
- Ahem, here we go.

00:00:23.101 --> 00:00:24.101
Dear sister,

00:00:29.236 --> 00:00:31.403
- This is definitely hard.

00:00:32.838 --> 00:00:34.941
- I'm in my head, I can't get out my head.

00:00:34.941 --> 00:00:37.614
- I don't remember how to write letters.

00:00:37.614 --> 00:00:38.947
What do you say?

00:00:43.182 --> 00:00:45.480
Thank God it is over.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.631
I'm never writing a letter again.

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:48.655
- This might be a cute thing that I could

00:00:48.655 --> 00:00:50.807
do with my grandma, definitely.

00:00:50.807 --> 00:00:53.881
- There's so much that came up for me when

00:00:53.881 --> 00:00:55.292
I wrote this letter that I don't

00:00:55.292 --> 00:00:58.000
think would have come
up if I was texting him.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.379
Sharing why he means so much to me,

00:01:00.379 --> 00:01:02.257
and how much he's changed my life in

00:01:02.257 --> 00:01:03.924
the past five years.

00:01:06.278 --> 00:01:08.006
That gets emotional.

00:01:08.006 --> 00:01:10.348
It's hard to address how you really feel

00:01:10.348 --> 00:01:12.880
about somebody and how
much someone means to you,

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:15.464
until you sit down and you
don't have your cellphone,

00:01:15.464 --> 00:01:17.809
you don't have any media, there's nothing,

00:01:17.809 --> 00:01:21.142
and you're just with the pen and paper.

